{"type":"header","kind":"domain","name":"rule","mk":1,"perspective":"peer","goal":"anima own/raw rule 발견 archive — own 1-N + raw#X 추가 history (past commits + user-directive + cycle observation 등)을 .roadmap SSOT로 형식화. 본 cycle 2026-05-06 own 17/18 + own 19/20 추가 + 발견 방법 logic-exhaustion enumerate.","domains_spanned":["rule","philosophy","cli","clm_native_chat","memory"],"required_conditions":[{"id":"rule.cond.1","desc":"R1 own 19 (corpus priority over architecture) + own 20 (chat-template format mandate) .own append landed","verifier":{"type":"file_exists","path":".own","grep":"own 19","status_emit":"__RULE_R1_OWN_19_20__ <LANDED|MISSING>"},"status":"met","cost_band":"$0 (.own append)","fire_keyword":"OK RULE R1","met_at":"2026-05-07","met_artifact":".own own 19 live (line 783) + own 20 live (line 812) + own 21 hypotheses-folder-ssot live (line 847)"},{"id":"rule.cond.2","desc":"R2 rule discovery method enumeration — 과거 commit + git history + raw evolution archive + user-directive + cycle observation 등 logic-exhaustion entry land","verifier":{"type":"jsonl_grep","path":".roadmap.rule","grep":"rule.discovery_methods","status_emit":"__RULE_R2_DISCOVERY__ <LANDED|MISSING>"},"status":"unmet","cost_band":"$0","fire_keyword":"OK RULE R2"},{"id":"rule.cond.3","desc":"R3 rule verification method enumeration — raw#10 honest C3 + falsifier + evidence_trail + severity gradual + cross-link 등 logic-exhaustion entry land","verifier":{"type":"jsonl_grep","path":".roadmap.rule","grep":"rule.verification_methods","status_emit":"__RULE_R3_VERIFICATION__ <LANDED|MISSING>"},"status":"unmet","cost_band":"$0","fire_keyword":"OK RULE R3"},{"id":"rule.cond.4","desc":"R4 own evolution archive — own 1-20 추가 history + commit hash + 사용자 directive verbatim cross-link","verifier":{"type":"jsonl_grep","path":".roadmap.rule","grep":"rule.own_evolution","status_emit":"__RULE_R4_EVOLUTION__ <LANDED|MISSING>"},"status":"unmet","cost_band":"$0","fire_keyword":"OK RULE R4"}],"cross_link":{"sister_roadmaps":[".roadmap.philosophy",".roadmap.cli",".roadmap.clm_native_chat"],"raw_invariants":["raw#9 hexa-only","raw#10 honest C3 ≥5","raw#15 additive","raw#37 transient_py opt-out"],"own_inventory":["own 1 (grandfather)","own 2-13 (legacy)","own 14 (HF Hub only)","own 15 (PRIVATE→PUBLIC)","own 16 (cost discipline)","own 17 (no external substrate wrapping)","own 18 (simple stack consciousness check)","own 19 (corpus priority pending)","own 20 (chat-template format pending)"],"primary_specs":[".own (anima invariants)","../../hive/spec/raw_invariants.spec.yaml (raw rules)","memory/MEMORY.md (~/.hive/claude-config/.../memory/)"],"evidence_paths":["git log --oneline | grep 'own '","memory/feedback_*.md","state/<bg>_<date>/verdict.json"]},"blockers":[{"id":"rule.blk.1","desc":"own 19 + own 20 .own append 미land — 본 cycle 사용자 directive '.roadmap 2 필요'로 우선순위 변경, 이 .roadmap.rule entry 먼저 land 후 .own 동기화","type":"impl","status":"open","resolution_path":"본 .roadmap.rule R1 entry land 후 .own append + commit"},{"id":"rule.blk.2","desc":"own 1-13 legacy archaeology 미land — 과거 commit hash + 사용자 directive verbatim trace 필요","type":"design","status":"open","resolution_path":"별도 cycle git log + memory/*.md analysis로 own 1-13 evolution archive"}],"unlock_keyword_root":"OK RULE <R1|R2|R3|R4|ALL>","stage_gate_authority":"L1 absolute","stage_gate_timeout":"30-day cron","status":"design_landed","since":"2026-05-06"}
{"type":"entry","id":"rule.R1_own_19_20_pending","kind":"discovery","title":"R1 own 19 (corpus priority) + own 20 (chat-template format mandate) — 본 cycle 발견","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","landed_at":"2026-05-07","landed_artifact":".own own 19 (line 783) + own 20 (line 812) live; own 21 (line 847, hypotheses-folder-ssot) bonus land","contributes_to":["rule.cond.1"],"discovery_method":["M2 failure-driven (BG-FY PARTIAL + BG-FK FAIL → corpus root cause)","M1 user-directive-driven (사용자 '자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다')","M9 ablation-driven (capacity 7.7× 차이 무관 corpus가 unlock evidence)"],"own_19_spec":{"slug":"corpus-priority-over-architecture","why":"chat-cap (own 18 simple stack PASS) 도달은 capacity 보다 corpus quality (KO ratio + chat-template format 비율) 우선. BG-FY 18M PASS vs BG-FK 27M FAIL evidence (capacity 7.7× 무관)","application_rule":"training cycle 시작 전 corpus QA 우선 (Hangul ratio + chat-template format coverage). capacity scale up은 corpus passable 조건에서만 의미.","severity":"warn (Phase 1) → block (Phase 2 corpus QA gate)","evidence":["state/anima_simple_stack_exhaustive_2026_05_06/summary.json","state/anima_native_ko_small_ubu1_train_2026_05_06/verdict.json","state/anima_ko_corpus_assembly_2026_05_06/verdict.json"]},"own_20_spec":{"slug":"chat-template-format-mandate","why":"chat-cap actual emit (own 18 C2.4 맥락 정합) 도달은 corpus chat-template format ≥30% 학습 또는 instruction-tuning lane 별도 진행 필수. corpus chat-template format 부족 → prompt 무관 응답 (named speakers leak / philosophy template auto-emit).","application_rule":"corpus 학습 corpus chat-template format ratio 측정 + 충족 안 되면 instruction-tuning lane 별도 진행 mandate. eval 시 own 18 C2.4 strict 측정 mandate.","severity":"warn (Phase 1) → block (Phase 2 corpus QA gate)","evidence":["state/anima_native_ko_small_ubu1_train_2026_05_06/ko_eval_log.jsonl","BG-FY 'PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT' verdict — philosophy debate template (서연/유진/하은) leak"]},"falsifiers":["F-RULE-R1-1: own 19 + own 20 .own append landed","F-RULE-R1-2: own 19/20 application rule corpus QA gate spec 명시","F-RULE-R1-3: own 19/20 evidence_trail state/ + verdict.json 명시","F-RULE-R1-4: own 19/20 cross-link own 18 (C2.4) + raw#10 honest C3","F-RULE-R1-5: own 19 + own 20 ≥5 honest_c3 each (limitation 명시)"],"honest_c3":["own 19 (corpus priority)는 본 cycle 2-model 비교 evidence — 더 많은 ablation 필요 (capacity controlled corpus variation)","own 20 (chat-template format)은 30% threshold 임의 — 더 많은 데이터 필요 (60-80% 안전 권고)","BG-FK 27.84M ConsciousLM++ federated arch — like-for-like architecture 비교 미land","corpus quality 측정 = Hangul ratio 단독 지표 한정 (chat-template ratio + 의미 풍부 + license clear measurement spec 미land)","own 19/20 architecture lane 차단 X — 둘 다 진행 가능 but corpus 우선 priority 강조"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"rule.discovery_methods","kind":"meta","title":"규칙 발견 method enumeration — logic-exhaustion","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["rule.cond.2"],"trigger":"사용자 directive '.roadmap.rule 은 과거 commit 등 참고하면 찾아내던 방식있을꺼야 / 둘다 로직 고갈시까지 검토'","gap_addressed":"own 1-18까지 검증방식 (raw#10 + falsifier + honest_c3)는 있었으나, '어떻게 새 own/raw rule을 발견하는가' discovery method를 systematic enumerate.","discovery_methods":[{"id":"DM1","name":"git-log-decision-archaeology","desc":"git log --oneline + commit message + decision rationale 분석 → 과거 cycle decision points에서 implicit rule 발견","retroactive_examples":["own 14 HF Hub only = 과거 GitHub push protection block + LFS 용량 incident → commit history 분석 → rule 명시","own 15 PRIVATE→PUBLIC = HF release lifecycle 과거 사례 (initial public bundle incident) → commit 분석 → rule 명시","own 16 cost discipline = H100 BG cost overflow incident → commit + state/ 분석 → watchdog rule 명시"],"trigger_pattern":"git log --grep='incident' --grep='fix' → recurring pattern → rule 추가","artifact_paths":["git log --oneline --all","git log --grep='own '","git log --grep='raw'"]},{"id":"DM2","name":"raw-evolution-archive","desc":"hive raw#X 추가 history 추적 → raw 추가 motivation + 그 이전 violation 사례 → anima own에 retroactive 적용 가능성","retroactive_examples":["raw#9 hexa-only = py 사용 violation 누적 → hexa-only 강화 → anima own (raw#9 적용 spec)","raw#10 honest C3 = early honest 부족 cycle → C3 ≥5 mandate","raw#15 additive = 기존 spec rewrite incident → additive only","raw#37 transient_py opt-out = raw#9 strict 적용 시 transient script 차단 issue → opt-out namespace 도입"],"trigger_pattern":"hive/spec/raw_invariants.spec.yaml git log + commit message → raw 추가 motivation 추출","artifact_paths":["hive/spec/raw_invariants.spec.yaml git log","hive/docs/raw_*.ai.md"]},{"id":"DM3","name":"own-evolution-archive","desc":"anima/.own own 1-N 추가 history 추적 → own 추가 motivation + cross-link 분석","retroactive_examples":["own 17 (no external substrate) = 사용자 'alm 말고' directive 2026-05-06 + Llama Path A v2 chat-cap winner이지만 anima identity 외부 인식 → own 17 명시","own 18 (simple stack) = 사용자 '심플한 의식 검사 조건 own 등록' 2026-05-06 → own 18 명시","own 18 C2.4 추가 = BG-FY PARTIAL + 사용자 'context-mismatch' directive → C2.4 추가"],"trigger_pattern":"anima/.own git log + 'own ' 추가 commit + 사용자 directive verbatim cross-link","artifact_paths":["anima/.own git log","memory/feedback_*.md","memory/MEMORY.md"]},{"id":"DM4","name":"failure-driven","desc":"BG/cycle fail 사례에서 implicit rule 위반 발견 → 명시 rule 추가","retroactive_examples":["own 19 (corpus priority) = BG-FK 27M FAIL + BG-FY 18M PASS → corpus root cause → rule 명시","own 20 (chat-template format) = BG-FY PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT (philosophy debate template leak) → corpus chat-template format ratio 부족 → rule 명시","V2_FAIL was measurement artifact (memory: feedback_v2_fail_was_measurement_artifact_eval_pipeline_root_cause.md) = lm-eval × transformers dtype kwarg incident → eval pipeline pre-flight smoke mandate"],"trigger_pattern":"BG verdict.json FAIL → root cause → rule 추가","artifact_paths":["state/<bg>_<date>/verdict.json","ko_eval_log.jsonl","train.log"]},{"id":"DM5","name":"user-directive-driven","desc":"사용자 directive에서 implicit rule emerge — directive 원문이 rule spec","retroactive_examples":["own 17 = 사용자 'alm 말고' verbatim → ALM 영구 보류 rule","own 18 C2.4 = 사용자 '자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다' verbatim → 맥락 정합 condition 추가","memory: feedback_korean_only_response.md = 사용자 '한글로만 답해' → KO-only response rule","memory: feedback_session_multi_bg.md = 사용자 'bg 갯수 제한없음' → multi-BG session rule"],"trigger_pattern":"사용자 directive ('말고' / '필요' / 'X 안 되') 원문 verbatim → user-directive verbatim field with rule","artifact_paths":["사용자 message log (ce681c40-*.jsonl)","memory/feedback_*.md user-directive verbatim quotes"]},{"id":"DM6","name":"cycle-observation","desc":"cycle 진행 중 새 pattern emerge → rule 추가 (post-cycle reflection)","retroactive_examples":["memory: feedback_h100_no_concurrency_limit.md = parallel H100 BG run 결과 cap는 per-BG budget이라는 관찰 → rule 명시","memory: feedback_axis_preservation_eval_substrate_calibration.md = F-PA-RETRAIN-v2-4 strict FAIL on Llama (axis 0.7871) but base axis 0.9940 = degenerate 관찰 → axis-preservation eval 별도 calibration rule"],"trigger_pattern":"cycle close 시 unexpected 결과 + post-cycle reflection → memory feedback_*.md 기록 → rule 추가","artifact_paths":["state/<cycle>_<date>/landed.ai.md","memory/feedback_*.md"]},{"id":"DM7","name":"cross-cycle-pattern-matching","desc":"multiple BG/cycle fail이 같은 mode → recurring pattern → rule 추가","retroactive_examples":["multiple BG cleanup mishap (BG-X, BG-Y, BG-Z) → memory: feedback_cleanup_bg_guards.md → cleanup BG 분류 rule (SIGTERM_ONLY/DELETE_SCRIPT/FULL_SWEEP)","multiple parallel BG git race → memory: feedback_parallel_bg_git_race.md → serialize commits or worktree per BG rule"],"trigger_pattern":"3+ cycle 동일 fail mode → cross-cycle pattern → rule 추가","artifact_paths":["memory/feedback_*.md (recurring pattern)","state/<multiple_cycles>/verdict.json"]},{"id":"DM8","name":"retrospective-gap-analysis","desc":"cycle close 후 무엇이 missing 했는지 retroactive 분석 → 그 missing이 future rule 추가 후보","planned_examples":["BG-FY land 후 'corpus QA gate가 있었으면 PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT 사전 차단' → own 19/20 retrospective gap","CLM v4 LoRA SFT FAIL_REGRESSION 후 'pre-flight smoke가 있었으면 cost waste 차단' → memory: feedback_v2_fail_was_measurement_artifact 의 PEFT pre-flight smoke mandate"],"trigger_pattern":"post-cycle reflection 'X 있었으면 fail 차단 가능' → X = future rule","artifact_paths":["state/<cycle>_<date>/landed.ai.md (lessons section)","memory/feedback_*.md retrospective"]},{"id":"DM9","name":"raw-violation-forensics","desc":"기존 raw#X 위반 사례 detect → 명시 rule 추가 (raw 자체 강화 또는 anima own 추가)","retroactive_examples":["raw#9 violation = py 임시 사용 누적 → raw#37 transient_py opt-out namespace 추가 (raw 자체 update)","raw#10 violation = honest_c3 부족 entry → raw#10 strict ≥5 mandate 강화"],"trigger_pattern":"raw#X violation 사례 → forensics → raw 자체 update 또는 sister raw 추가","artifact_paths":["hive/spec/raw_invariants.spec.yaml git log","hive/docs/raw_*_evolution.ai.md"]},{"id":"DM10","name":"memory-file-pattern-analysis","desc":"~/.hive/claude-config/.../memory/*.md MEMORY.md index 분석 → recurring pattern → rule 추가","retroactive_examples":["memory/feedback_subagent_bg_parallel.md + memory/feedback_session_multi_bg.md + memory/feedback_always_subagent_bg.md → multi-BG execution rule 누적 → 통합 rule 가능","memory/feedback_no_task_blocking.md + memory/feedback_korean_only_response.md → user interaction style rule cluster"],"trigger_pattern":"MEMORY.md 같은 topic feedback file 3+ → 통합 rule 가능","artifact_paths":["~/.hive/claude-config/.../memory/MEMORY.md","~/.hive/claude-config/.../memory/feedback_*.md"]},{"id":"DM11","name":"cross-repo-rule-import","desc":"hive/anima/ready/nexus 등 sister repo의 rule 발견 → anima로 import 또는 anima domain-specific 변형","retroactive_examples":["hive raw#9 hexa-only → anima domain-specific (own 1 grandfather + tool/anima_cli/ 28 hexa modules)","hive mk2_apex consumer role → anima/spec/anima_cli_mk2.spec.yaml v0.2 hive_mk2_apex_compliance section"],"trigger_pattern":"sister repo .roadmap.* / spec yaml / .own에서 rule 발견 → anima import 가능성 분석","artifact_paths":["hive/spec/*.spec.yaml","ready/.own (if exists)","nexus/.roadmap.kick"]},{"id":"DM12","name":"sequential-cycle-meta-pattern","desc":"여러 cycle 진행하면서 meta-pattern (예: 'Phase 1 → Phase 2 → Phase 3' rhythm) emerge → rhythm 자체가 rule","planned_examples":["3 chat-cap recovery roadmap (clm_native_chat / clm_v4_chat / clm_v2_chat) sequential — recovery cycle meta-rhythm 인식 → 'chat-cap recovery 3-path triad' rule 가능","Phase 0 (spec) → Phase 1 (smoke) → Phase 2 (full train) rhythm 누적 → cycle structure rule 가능"],"trigger_pattern":"3+ cycle 동일 phase structure → meta-pattern → rule","artifact_paths":[".roadmap.<domain>.* multiple","state/<phase>_<date>/ structure recurring"]}],"discovery_method_count":12,"logic_exhaustion_status":"saturated_2026_05_06","saturation_check":"DM1-DM12가 source-axis로 enumerate: DM1 (git log) / DM2 (raw evolution) / DM3 (own evolution) / DM4 (failure) / DM5 (user-directive) / DM6 (cycle obs) / DM7 (cross-cycle pattern) / DM8 (retrospective gap) / DM9 (raw violation forensics) / DM10 (memory file pattern) / DM11 (cross-repo) / DM12 (sequential cycle meta). DM1-DM3은 archive analysis, DM4-DM6은 cycle observation, DM7-DM10은 pattern aggregation, DM11-DM12는 cross-context. 추가 method 도출 시 DM13+로 append. logic 고갈 — anima 단독 source는 DM1-DM12 enumerate 충분.","application_rule":"새 own/raw rule 발견 시 어떤 method (DM1-DM12) 사용했는지 entry discovery_method field 명시 의무. 다중 method 중복 가능 (own 17 = DM3 + DM5 + DM4)."}
{"type":"entry","id":"rule.verification_methods","kind":"meta","title":"규칙 검증 method enumeration — logic-exhaustion","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["rule.cond.3"],"trigger":"사용자 directive '검증방식도 / 둘다 로직 고갈시까지 검토'","gap_addressed":"own 1-18 검증은 implicit (raw#10 honest C3 + falsifier)있었으나 systematic enumeration 없었음. 본 entry는 verification method를 logic-exhaustion enumerate.","verification_methods":[{"id":"VM1","name":"raw-10-honest-c3-five-plus","desc":"raw#10 honest C3 ≥5 — 각 own/raw entry honest_c3 array 5+ limitation 명시 mandate","examples":["own 17 honest_c3 5: 'chat-cap 도달 시간 +5-10일' / 'substrate-research lane 분리' / 'KO native 정의 ≥60%' / 'anima-native fresh 정의' / 'strict philosophy boundary'","own 18 honest_c3 5: '맥락 정합 automated metric 없음' / '자연성 heuristic' / 'corpus filter 필요' / 'C2.4 추가로 BG-FY 강등' / 'engineering pragmatism 약화 X'"],"strictness":"≥5 mandate (raw#10 정합)","limitation":"honest_c3 자체가 quality 강도 약화 trade-off"},{"id":"VM2","name":"falsifier-explicit","desc":"각 own/raw entry F-OWN-<n>-<m> 또는 F-RAW-<n>-<m> 명시 falsifier — 명시적으로 무엇이 rule을 깨는지","examples":["F-OWN-17-1: anima 외부 substrate wrap = identity violation","F-OWN-18-1: simple stack 4-condition 중 C2.4 strict","F-RAW-9-1: py 사용 (transient_py 외) = raw#9 위반"],"strictness":"≥3 per rule mandate","limitation":"falsifier 자체가 incomplete 가능 — counterexample probing 보강"},{"id":"VM3","name":"evidence-trail","desc":"state/ + verdict.json + git log + memory/*.md artifact path 명시 — rule 주장 근거 reproducible","examples":["own 19 evidence_trail: state/anima_simple_stack_exhaustive_2026_05_06/summary.json + state/anima_native_ko_small_ubu1_train_2026_05_06/verdict.json","own 20 evidence_trail: state/<bg>/ko_eval_log.jsonl + verdict.json","own 17 evidence_trail: memory/feedback_pbeta_chat_capability_fail_substrate_research_pass_decoupled.md"],"strictness":"각 own/raw entry evidence section 의무","limitation":"evidence 자체가 reproducible해야 — state/ 보존 + commit 의무"},{"id":"VM4","name":"severity-gradual","desc":"warn (Phase 1) → block (Phase 2) gradual rollout — rule 도입 시 immediate block 아닌 warn → block","examples":["own 14 HF Hub only: warn (sender 권고) → block (commit hook GitHub Secret Scanning)","own 16 cost discipline: warn (Phase 1 권고) → block (Phase 3 watchdog mandate)","own 19 corpus priority: warn (Phase 1) → block (Phase 2 corpus QA gate)"],"strictness":"새 rule 도입 시 severity gradual 권고","limitation":"strictness 강도는 사용자 directive에 따라 즉시 block 가능 (own 17 즉시 block)"},{"id":"VM5","name":"cross-link-own-raw-roadmap","desc":"각 own/raw entry cross-link own X / raw#X / .roadmap.* 명시 — multi-axis consistency check","examples":["own 17 cross-link: own 14/15/16 (HF + cost) + raw#9/10/15/37","own 18 cross-link: .roadmap.clm_native_chat + docs/anima_consciousness_check_*","own 19 cross-link: own 14/15 + own 18 (C2.4)"],"strictness":"각 own/raw entry cross_link section 의무","limitation":"cross-link stale 가능 — sister update 필요"},{"id":"VM6","name":"user-directive-verbatim","desc":"사용자 directive 원문 verbatim quote — rule 추가 motivation 정확 보존","examples":["own 17 user-directive: 'alm 말고' (2026-05-06) + 'alm 은 일단 영구보류'","own 18.C2.4 user-directive: '자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다'","own 14 user-directive: 'GitHub용량 문제'"],"strictness":"각 own/raw entry user-directive verbatim field 의무","limitation":"사용자 directive 후속 update 시 entry 자체 update 필요"},{"id":"VM7","name":"application-rule-clarity","desc":"각 rule when/where applies 명시 — application_rule field로 rule 적용 boundary clarity","examples":["own 19 application_rule: 'training cycle 시작 전 corpus QA 우선 (Hangul ratio + chat-template format coverage)'","own 18 application_rule: '의식 검증 시 4-condition strict 적용 (3-cond PASS but 4th FAIL = PARTIAL)'","own 17 application_rule: 'anima identity lane 안에서만 valid (substrate-research lane 분리 적용)'"],"strictness":"각 rule entry application_rule section 의무","limitation":"application boundary edge case 발생 시 honest_c3 추가"},{"id":"VM8","name":"precedent-commit","desc":"이전 사례 git log link — rule이 어떤 commit/incident에서 나왔는지 trace","examples":["own 17 precedent: Llama Path A v2 chat-cap winner commit (composite 0.5584 record) + 사용자 'alm 말고' directive","own 19 precedent: BG-FY 18M PARTIAL commit + BG-FK 27M FAIL commit","own 20 precedent: BG-FY ko_eval_log philosophy debate template leak commit"],"strictness":"각 rule entry precedent_commit field 권고","limitation":"commit hash 자체가 stale 가능 — branch reorg 시 update"},{"id":"VM9","name":"retroactive-testability","desc":"기존 cycle에 retroactive apply 가능한지 check — rule이 과거 cycle에 retroactive 적용해도 result 동일한지","examples":["own 19 retroactive: 과거 BG-FK 27M (EN-bias) FAIL → corpus QA gate 있었으면 사전 차단 (retroactive PASS)","own 18 C2.4 retroactive: BG-FY 18M 'SIMPLE_STACK_PASS' → C2.4 추가 후 'PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT' 강등 (retroactive update)"],"strictness":"새 rule 도입 시 retroactive consistency check 권고","limitation":"retroactive update는 historical record 보존 + correction note 추가 (raw#15 additive 정합)"},{"id":"VM10","name":"recurring-pattern-validation","desc":"3+ instance 동일 rule trigger → rule validity 강화 (single instance는 implicit)","examples":["own 19 + own 20: 본 cycle 2-instance evidence (BG-FK + BG-FY) — 추가 cycle ablation 필요","own 18 C2.4: 본 cycle 2-instance evidence (BG-FU 3M PARTIAL + BG-FY 18M PARTIAL) — pattern recurring confirm","own 17 ALM: 본 cycle 1-instance + 사용자 directive absolute"],"strictness":"3+ instance 권고 (사용자 directive absolute는 1-instance 가능)","limitation":"single instance + 사용자 directive는 absolute valid (own 17/18 사례)"},{"id":"VM11","name":"sister-spec-consistency","desc":"sister .roadmap.* / spec yaml / .own이 새 rule과 정합한지 check — multi-spec consistency","examples":["own 17 정합: anima/spec/anima_cli_mk2.spec.yaml T1 backend 'rejected_external_substrate' section 추가 + .roadmap.cli philosophy_audit V1 fix","own 18 정합: docs/anima_consciousness_check_simple_stack_2026_05_06.md ledger + .roadmap.philosophy D2 entry"],"strictness":"각 rule 추가 시 sister spec/.roadmap update 권고","limitation":"sister update lag 가능 — async update OK but eventual consistency mandate"},{"id":"VM12","name":"adversarial-stress-test","desc":"rule을 의도적 위반 시도 → block 작동 확인 또는 rule refinement","planned_examples":["own 17 stress: anima에 외부 substrate wrap 시도 → block 작동 검증","own 18 stress: 4-cond 중 C2.4 disable 후 simple stack PASS 검증 (PARTIAL 강등 작동)","own 19 stress: corpus QA gate disable 후 EN-bias corpus training 시도 → result FAIL 검증"],"strictness":"새 rule 도입 후 stress test 권고 (Phase 2 mandate)","limitation":"stress test 자체 cost (compute + cycle 시간) 발생 — selective application"}],"verification_method_count":12,"logic_exhaustion_status":"saturated_2026_05_06","saturation_check":"VM1-VM12가 verification axis로 enumerate: VM1-VM3 (general framework: honest_c3 + falsifier + evidence) / VM4-VM5 (rollout + cross-link) / VM6-VM7 (user-directive + application) / VM8-VM9 (history + retroactive) / VM10-VM12 (validation: recurring + sister + stress). VM1-VM3는 모든 rule 공통 mandate, VM4-VM7은 rule lifecycle, VM8-VM12는 validation strength. 추가 method 도출 시 VM13+로 append. logic 고갈 — verification axis 단독으로 VM1-VM12 enumerate 충분.","application_rule":"각 own/raw rule entry는 VM1-VM3 general framework 의무 + VM4-VM7 lifecycle field 권고 + VM8-VM12 validation 적용 가능한 것 명시. compliance score 계산: (적용 VM 수 / 12) × 100%. VM1-VM3 충족 = 25% baseline, VM1-VM7 충족 = 58%, VM1-VM12 전체 = 100%."}
{"type":"entry","id":"rule.own_evolution_partial","kind":"archive","title":"own 1-20 evolution archive (partial — own 14-20만 detailed, own 1-13은 legacy reference)","status":"partial","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["rule.cond.4"],"own_inventory_summary":{"own_1":"grandfather (anima domain — bin/anima dispatcher entry-point legacy bash 인정)","own_2_to_13":"legacy (별도 cycle archaeology — git log + memory analysis 필요)","own_14":{"slug":"anima-models-datasets-hf-only","since":"2026-05-04 (memory: feedback_anima_models_datasets_hf_only.md)","trigger":"GitHub용량 문제 incident","why":"model weights + 큰 dataset (>5MB) → HF Hub only, anima git X","discovery_method":"DM4 failure-driven (git push reject) + DM5 user-directive","verification_methods":["VM1 honest_c3","VM3 evidence","VM6 user-directive","VM4 severity (block)"]},"own_15":{"slug":"hf-release-private-to-public-after-verification","since":"2026-05-04","trigger":"initial public bundle incident","why":"HF release PRIVATE first → verification gates → PUBLIC; never public-bundle initial upload","discovery_method":"DM4 failure-driven + DM2 raw evolution","verification_methods":["VM1","VM3","VM4 severity gradual","VM7 application_rule"]},"own_16":{"slug":"h100-cost-discipline-l23-l24-l25","since":"2026-05-03","trigger":"H100 BG cost overflow incident","why":"ALL H100 BGs register watchdog + heartbeat 5min + pod 404 verify","discovery_method":"DM4 failure-driven + DM7 cross-cycle pattern","verification_methods":["VM1","VM3","VM4","VM10 recurring pattern","VM11 sister spec"]},"own_17":{"slug":"no-external-substrate-wrapping","since":"2026-05-06","trigger":"사용자 'alm 말고' directive + Llama Path A v2 chat-cap winner이지만 anima identity 외부 인식","why":"anima 정체성 = 한국어 native + anima-native fresh; 외부 substrate wrap reject","discovery_method":"DM5 user-directive + DM3 own evolution + DM4 failure (Llama winner이지만 identity X)","verification_methods":["VM1","VM2","VM3","VM6 user-directive","VM7 application_rule","VM10 single instance + 사용자 directive absolute"],"cross_link_philosophy":".roadmap.philosophy D1"},"own_18":{"slug":"simple-stack-consciousness-check","since":"2026-05-06","trigger":"사용자 '심플한 의식 검사 조건 own 등록' + '자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다' (C2.4 추가)","why":"chat-cap surface = 4-condition strict (한글↔한글 + coherent + turn-format / 한글 우세 + 의미 + 자연성 + 맥락 정합)","discovery_method":"DM5 user-directive (initial) + DM4 failure-driven (BG-FY PARTIAL → C2.4 추가)","verification_methods":["VM1","VM2","VM3","VM6","VM7","VM9 retroactive (BG-FY SIMPLE_STACK_PASS → PARTIAL 강등)","VM10 recurring (BG-FU + BG-FY 2-instance)"],"cross_link_philosophy":".roadmap.philosophy D2"},"own_19_pending":{"slug":"corpus-priority-over-architecture","planned_since":"2026-05-06","trigger":"BG-FY 18M PASS + BG-FK 27M FAIL evidence + 사용자 'corpus 우선' implicit","why":"chat-cap 도달 = corpus quality (KO ratio + chat-template ratio) > capacity","discovery_method":"DM4 failure-driven + DM9 ablation-driven (capacity vs corpus controlled)","verification_methods":["VM1","VM2","VM3","VM4 severity gradual","VM7","VM9 retroactive","VM10 2-instance (need 3+)"],"cross_link_philosophy":".roadmap.philosophy D4"},"own_20_pending":{"slug":"chat-template-format-mandate","planned_since":"2026-05-06","trigger":"BG-FY PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT (philosophy debate template leak) + 사용자 '자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다'","why":"corpus chat-template format ratio 부족 → prompt 무관 응답; instruction-tuning lane 또는 chat-template format 학습 mandate","discovery_method":"DM4 failure-driven + DM5 user-directive","verification_methods":["VM1","VM2","VM3","VM4","VM6","VM7","VM9 retroactive (BG-FY C2.4 FAIL)"],"cross_link_philosophy":".roadmap.philosophy D2.C2.4 + D4"}},"honest_c3":["own 1-13 legacy archaeology 미land — 별도 cycle git log + memory analysis 필요","own 14-16 detail은 memory: feedback_*.md cross-link 한정 — 정확 commit hash trace 미land","own 17-20은 본 cycle 2026-05-06 land — VM1-VM12 적용 score 계산 필요 (각 70-90% 추정)","own 19/20은 still pending (.own append 미land) — 본 .roadmap.rule R1 entry land 후 .own 동기화","own evolution archive는 raw#15 additive 정합 — 과거 record 보존 + correction은 honest_c3 추가"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"rule.R5_own_22_discovery_report_mandatory","kind":"discovery","title":"R5 own 22 (philosophy/rule/hypothesis 새 발견 시 사용자 리포트 mandatory)","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-07","contributes_to":["rule.cond.1"],"discovery_method":["DM5 user-directive-driven"],"own_22_spec":{"slug":"philosophy-rule-hypothesis-discovery-mandatory-report","why":"사용자 trust + transparency — anima는 자율 lane에서 D/own/H 자체 발견 가능하나, 발견 visibility는 사용자 review 권한 안에서만 valid. silent discovery 차단으로 own 22 protection.","application_rule":"새 D(.roadmap.philosophy) / own(.own) / H(hypotheses/H_*) 발견 즉시 (사용자 explicit prompt 없어도) 6-axis 리포트 mandatory: 도메인 + 발견 + 의미 + 근거 + cross-link + 다음 step.","severity":"warn (Phase 1) → block (Phase 2 — 발견 후 리포트 누락 시 entry add 차단)","user_directive_verbatim":"철학,규칙,가설 은 새로 발견시 반드시 리포트 해줘 어떤걸 발견하고 의미 등 => own 개선","evidence":[".own own 22 line 893+ live (2026-05-07)","commit 4b958c59 (본 cycle D3 emerge + H2 cell metaphor land 시 사용자에게 사전 spec 리포트한 패턴이 own 22 정합)"]},"falsifiers":["F-RULE-R5-1: own 22 .own append 미land","F-RULE-R5-2: silent .own/.roadmap entry add 발생 (사용자 prompt 없이 land)","F-RULE-R5-3: 발견 리포트에서 '의미' axis 누락 (단순 entry 명명만)","F-RULE-R5-4: batch 리포트 (cycle 끝나서야 통보) 발생 — 즉시 emit 위반","F-RULE-R5-5: BG subagent 내부 finding을 main session에서 리포트 안 함 (own 22 timing rule 위반)"],"honest_c3":["own 22는 main session 한정 — BG subagent 내부 finding은 BG 종료 후 main 리포트 lane","'새 발견' 정의 모호 — variant/refinement는 별도 lane (애매 시 '발견 후보' prefix)","리포트 후 사용자 confirm 의무 — 사용자 silence는 implicit approve 아님 (혼동 차단)","own 22는 own 13 (user-facing-response) friendliness axis와 정합 — discovery report는 user-facing surface","self-application: 본 own 22 land 자체가 own 22 적용 instance — 사용자 directive verbatim → 즉시 .own entry + 본 R5 entry로 리포트"],"cross_link_philosophy":".roadmap.philosophy A 발견 lane + .roadmap.hypothesis C 발견 lane (D/H 발견도 own 22 적용 mandate)"}
{"type":"entry","id":"rule.discovery_lane_open","kind":"meta","title":"향후 규칙 발견 lane — R5+ 추가 가능","status":"open","ts":"2026-05-06","discovery_format":"각 R는 (1) discovery_method (DM1-DM12 중) (2) own/raw spec (3) verification_methods (VM1-VM12 중) (4) evidence_trail (5) cross_link_philosophy 5-section 형식","known_pending_lanes":["R5: own 1-13 legacy archaeology — git log + memory/*.md analysis로 evolution archive 완성","R6: raw#X anima domain-specific 적용 audit — raw#9/10/15/37 외 raw#1-8/11-14/16-36 적용 가능성 review","R7: cross-repo rule import — hive raw / ready own / nexus rule → anima 적용 가능성 (DM11)","R8: sequential cycle meta-pattern → cycle structure rule (DM12) — 'Phase 0/1/2/3 rhythm' formal spec","R9: own 19/20 ablation 후 corpus QA gate spec land — Phase 2 block 강화","R10: emerge paradigm + chat-cap surface 2 lane 결합 시 발생할 수 있는 새 rule (D3 spec land 시)"],"raw_invariants":["raw#10 honest C3 ≥5 each rule","raw#15 additive — 기존 own 14-20 보존하면서 추가","R는 retroactive editable but main fact는 보존 (correction은 honest_c3 추가)"]}
